Video pixel-format negotiation table (src/video-ops/formats.ts)

src/video-ops/formats.ts adapts the video pixel-format negotiation of FFmpeg
libavfilter/avfiltergraph.c (pick_format with a reference link) and
libavfilter/formats.c (merge_formats_internal) shared by the linear,
frame-graph and timed negotiators. The loss scoring follows get_pix_fmt_score,
get_color_type and av_find_best_pix_fmt_of_2 in libavutil/pixdesc.c.

The table of every non-hwaccel pixel format, in AVPixelFormat order, records
nb_components, log2_chroma_w, log2_chroma_h, flags, component depths and
av_get_padded_bits_per_pixel from av_pix_fmt_desc_get, and the vf_scale
query_formats lists (libavfilter/vf_scale.c, sws_test_format in
libswscale/format.c), as built from the pinned sources.

